  m_text: A fire broke out late at night at a local warehouse, rapidly spreading
    through the structure and causing severe internal damage before emergency services
    brought it under control. Initial reports suggested a possible accident, but
    fire investigators have since determined the blaze shows clear signs of deliberate
    ignition, with multiple points of origin and no obvious accidental cause. Parts
    of the building appear to have been specifically targeted, and key materials
    stored inside were destroyed in the process. No fatalities were reported, but
    the incident is now being treated as suspicious, with the possibility that the
    fire was started intentionally to remove or conceal something within the warehouse.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
